    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "它们的横坐标是 $-4.6$ 和 $2.6$。$-4.6$ 和 $2.6$ 就是方程 $\\frac{12}{x}=x ↵ +2$ 的根的近似值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，当 $x=-4.6$ 时，有",
        "$\\frac{12}{x}=\\frac{12}{-4.6}\\approx-2.6$， $x+2=-4.6+2=-2.6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $x=2.6$ 时，有",
        "$\\frac{12}{x}=\\frac{12}{2.6}=4.6$， $x+2=2.6+2=4.6$。"
      ]
    },
